  unitName: Hadaron
  unitId: 860134
  unitNumber: 8074
  description: Created by the old gods, birthed from the deep fires of earth, Hadaron
    is a demi-god with a toughened body that could withstand high pressure and extreme
    heat. Though his combat prowess could not match Ultor and Tridon, he overcomes
    tough situations with perseverance and sheer determination. Zedus appointed Hadaron
    in guarding the under city beneath Athensphere, for demons and corruption didn't
    just come from the sea and the lands above. With the help of Gazia, he setup
    the under city defenses. Hadaron treated Gazia like a brother and were close,
    but he could never understand Gazia's cold and hardend mind in pursuit for power
    and breakthroughs.
  summonDesc: No matter how demanding a challenge is, all I need is time.
  fusionDesc: Fire and steel will not break me.
